  Adventure Land game data
    https://adventure.land/data.js
    Fetched by the image build (npm run fetch-data). Not stored in this repository.

The test sell point described in the README is added at container start by our own script
(scripts/local/patch_merchants.mjs) into the locally cloned map data; only a merchant
coordinate is written, no game source or data is redistributed.

Adventure Land is created and maintained by its authors. This container is not affiliated with
them and is intended for local use; the game's own terms govern the game.
